87%). 1H NMR (200 MHz, CDCl3, ppm): δ 1.08 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 12H), 1.31 (d,
J = 6.8 Hz, 6H), 1.41 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 6H), 2.54 (sept, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H),
