J = 2.1 Hz, 1H), 10.52 (s, 1H). 13C NMR (50 MHz, CDCl3, ppm): δ 23.0,
24.0, 24.1, 30.3, 34.2, 38.2, 120.6, 131.2, 131.9, 135.0, 135.3, 138.6,
